# Test: OSPFv2 SPF-explain (why a route won).
#
# VALIDATES: spec-ospf-ext-14 -- `show ospf spf detail` lists candidate paths + the RFC 2328 section 16.4 tie-break, read-only (route table + run count unchanged) (AC-9).
# PREVENTS: a regression in the OSPF debug/introspection surface.
#
# Live FRR/QEMU multicast convergence is owned by the ospf-debug-*-frr interop scenarios.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf/spf -run 'TestSPFExplainCandidateList|TestSPFExplainTieBreak|TestSPFExplainNoRecompute' -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=TestSPFExplainCandidateList
expect=stdout:contains=TestSPFExplainTieBreak
expect=stdout:contains=TestSPFExplainNoRecompute
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
